    <Section type="report" startTime="0.0" endTime="120.491">
      <Turn startTime="0.0" endTime="4.789" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="0.0"/>The town of<Event desc="loc" type="entities" extent="begin"/>Paris<Event desc="loc" type="entities" extent="end"/>is served by the Coahoma County School District.</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="4.789" endTime="9.563" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="4.789"/>[pronpi]</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="9.563" endTime="16.031" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="9.563"/>After effecting electrical repairs, the plane safely took off and continued to Oshkosh.</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="16.031" endTime="20.966" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="16.031"/>Arundel High School's rival school is South River High School.</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="20.966" endTime="26.633" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="20.966"/>[nontrans]</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="26.633" endTime="31.61" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="26.633"/>As the wings' lift disappeared, a fatal sink rate was induced.</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="31.61" endTime="37.066" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="31.61"/>This emplacement and a similar tower nearby were (de)stroyed during the Peninsular War.</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="37.066" endTime="41.081" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="37.066"/>Brown was born in Maquoketa, [pronpi].</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="41.081" endTime="46.092" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="41.081"/>His career continued in sports publishing, and sporting goods businesses.</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="46.092" endTime="51.691" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="46.092"/>Faulkner and Reiter went on to form the New York Ska Jazz Ensemble.</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="51.691" endTime="57.827" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="51.691"/>It was named for the small town of Aitape, Sandaun Province, Papua New Guinea. [nontrans]</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="57.827" endTime="64.074" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="57.827"/>Maori" then rescued some of the survivors from "Bismarck" after the battleship sank.</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="64.074" endTime="68.904" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="64.074"/>The previously constructed bridge had to be disassembled and re-anchored.</Turn>
