      <Turn startTime="72.271" endTime="76.428" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="72.271"/>Salcedo, desolate and grieving, returned to Ilocos.</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="76.428" endTime="88.80396875" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="76.428"/>Some American [pronpi], like Newark, Cincinnati and Rochester, were initially built around canals. It starred Brian Dennehy as Clarence Darrow and Fred Thompson as William Jennings Bryan</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="88.80396875" endTime="93.455" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="88.80396875"/>It is the county seat of Northampton County.</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="93.455" endTime="97.588" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="93.455"/>The present-day cities were created on nearby sites after the lake was impounded.</Turn>
