      <Turn startTime="98.821" endTime="103.658" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="98.821"/>In the fifth century, the text was translated into a rather mediocre Greek.</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="103.658" endTime="106.155" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="103.658"/>Walford grew up in Sydney.</Turn>
      <Turn startTime="106.155" endTime="120.491" speaker="spk1"><Sync time="106.155"/>Gobryas' family was closely entwined with the family of Darius the Great. He is compared to John Hollander and Philip Larkin. Cooper was subsequently hospitalized with a high fever.</Turn>
